OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FBright or
OL,6,Fclear spells and a few showers through
OL,7,Fthe evening. Showers become mostly
OL,8,Fconfined to counties Derry and Tyrone
OL,9,Fovernight, becoming dry with clear
OL,10,Fspells elsewhere.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FDry with sunny spells for most
OL,13,Fto start. Then clouding over with a
OL,14,Ffew showers breaking out for a time,
OL,15,Fbecoming drier through the afternoon.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FMainly
OL,18,Fdry although rather cloudy at times
OL,19,Fover the weekend. Dry with more in the
OL,20,Fway of sunshine on Monday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
